      en: ["Toledo is located 22 km north of the center of Montevideo.", "The city was founded around the train station inaugurated in 1889.", "It is located at the junction of National Routes 6 and 33.", "The 2011 census recorded a population of 4,397 for the city proper.", "The municipality of Toledo has over 30,000 inhabitants.", "The settlement was declared a 'Villa' (town) on May 28, 1928, by Law No. 8.243.", "Wine production is an important part of the local economy.", "Toledo was elevated to the status of city (Ciudad) on November 27, 1995, by Law No. 16.722."],
