      en: ["Renamed on May 3, 1908.", "The population is approximately 2,659 (2011 census).", "Named after Uruguayan president Tomás Gomensoro.", "Originally, the location was named 'Zanja Honda'.", "Important agricultural products are rice and sugarcane.", "Located on National Route 30."],
