      en: ["Founded on October 25, 1908.", "Elevated to 'Villa' status on July 5, 1956.", "The population was 2,402 as of the 2011 census.", "The railway station was inaugurated in 1912.", "Named after the Casupá stream.", "Hosts the annual 'Festival de la Forestal'."],
