      en: ["Elevated to 'Villa' status on October 20, 1994.", "Located immediately west of Treinta y Tres city.", "Separated from the capital by the Olimar River.", "The population was 6,782 as of the 2011 census.", "The name 'Ejido' refers to historical communal land.", "Predominantly a residential town for commuters to Treinta y Tres."],
